    "seoTitle": "How VCs Are Evaluating AI Startups in 2026 | Bugwrite",
    "metaDescription": "Venture investors have moved past flashy AI demos, scrutinizing gross margins after inference costs, proprietary data moats, and enterprise renewal durability.",
